{"id":"f2f999bbeb3c1da6","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pcp-prefix-decidability.md","title":"部分解可逐项判定、完整解前缀相容","display":"thm-pcp-prefix-decidability — 部分解可逐项判定、完整解前缀相容","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pcp-prefix-decidability","aliases":["73-thm-pcp-prefix-decidability"],"display":"thm-pcp-prefix-decidability — 部分解可逐项判定、完整解前缀相容","depends_on":["[[73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes]]","[[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]","[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.4 boxed discussion, print p. 404; PDF p. 426; computability qualification clarified","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pcp-prefix-decidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pcp-prefix-decidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pcp-prefix-decidability — 部分解可逐项判定、完整解前缀相容"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c68b36d66d7486d0\" href=\"?note=c68b36d66d7486d0\" title=\"73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes\">73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" href=\"?note=3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" title=\"73-df-binary-pcp-coding\">73-df-binary-pcp-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.4 boxed discussion, print p. 404; PDF p. 426; computability qualification clarified"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" href=\"?note=3e0e5af1ab7985ee\" title=\"73-df-binary-pcp-coding\">73-df-binary-pcp-coding</a>。在前两个子句中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k\">\\(I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}\">\\(j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}\\)</span>；序列截取由下式定义。最后的集合构造独立绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,I,\\iota\">\\(k,I,\\iota\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairBits}\">\\(\\operatorname{PairBits}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatListCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{NatListCode}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota{\\upharpoonright}j\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota(h):0\\le h&lt;j\\rangle\\quad(j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota{\\upharpoonright}j\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota(h):0\\le h&lt;j\\rangle\\quad(j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PCPSol}_{\\mathbf2}(I,\\iota)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}\\;\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota{\\upharpoonright}j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PCPSol}_{\\mathbf2}(I,\\iota)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}\\;\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota{\\upharpoonright}j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PCPCOMP}_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(I),\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\iota)):\nk\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k,\\\n\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{PCPCOMP}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PCPCOMP}_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(I),\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\iota)):\nk\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\ I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k,\\\n\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{&lt;\\omega},\\\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{PCPCOMP}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>完整解的两行相等，故任一有限前缀两行都是同一词的前缀，必相容。给定一个候选列表，直接拼接比较即可判定相容；依长度枚举所有候选并过滤，可以枚举全部相容部分解。教材“不可能计算所有部分解”的表述应理解为不能普遍通过有界完成搜索解决 PCP，不能误读为不存在逐项算法或枚举器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes","status":"resolved","id":"c68b36d66d7486d0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pcp-compatible-prefixes]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-pcp-coding","status":"resolved","id":"3e0e5af1ab7985ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-pcp-coding","status":"resolved","id":"3e0e5af1ab7985ee","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$；$\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]。在前两个子句中，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k$，$\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}$；序列截取由下式定义。最后的集合构造独立绑定 $k,I,\\iota$；$\\operatorname{PairBits}$ 与 $\\operatorname{NatListCode}$ 采用 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$；$\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-pcp-coding]]。在前两个子句中，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k$，$\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}$；序列截取由下式定义。最后的集合构造独立绑定 $k,I,\\iota$；$\\operatorname{PairBits}$ 与 $\\operatorname{NatListCode}$ 采用 [[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k,I,\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairBits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NatListCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota{\\upharpoonright}j\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota(h):0\\le h<j\\rangle\\quad(j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PCPSol}_{\\mathbf2}(I,\\iota)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|\\iota|\\}\\;\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota{\\upharpoonright}j).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PCPCOMP}_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{listcode}_{\\mathcal E}(I),\\operatorname{NatListCode}(\\iota)):\nk\\in\\mathbb N_{>0},\\ I\\in(\\mathbf2^+\\times\\mathbf2^+)^k,\\\n\\iota\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k-1\\}^{<\\omega},\\\n\\operatorname{Compatible}_I(\\iota)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{PCPCOMP}_{\\mathcal E}\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}.","display":true}],"bytes":2405,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985